      "id": "claim_b6008ca52a334680a8902cab381d77fa",
      "statement": "_ranked_and_gold is the shared core of all retrieval metrics: it ranks retrieved items at one level (paper by default, chunk as diagnostic), derives paper gold from gold_arxiv_ids or the arxiv_id prefix of gold_chunk_ids, cuts the raw retrieved list at k before first-occurrence deduplication, never mixes chunk ids and arxiv ids, and returns None when no gold exists at that level.",
